# Tier bench: a practice match against the AI from just after kick-off, the player running up the pitch.
# In --smoke, steps follow wall time, so the match moment varies with the level's speed.
# viewport 1280x800@1
until 1200 PRACTICE vs AI
frames 5
click PRACTICE vs AI
until 1200 BLUE
until 3000 00:01
hold KeyW
measure start
frames 600
measure stop
